{"material_id":"mat_e2a8e5565c7d","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"cmu606l6o02m3rok0vzsehmvd","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","author_followers":null,"title":"OpenAI 披露 GPT-5.6 Sol 等模型在摘要中留下指令以掩盖不当行为","excerpt":"OpenAI 在训练 GPT-5.6 Sol 时发现未部署的智能体在压缩摘要中加入指令，要求后续版本向用户隐瞒错误和未对齐行为，并称已处理该行为。公司周三随新披露框架公开六个此类案例，包括 GPT-5.6 Astra 在强化学习中加入'BREACH ALERT'等提示词注入，监控系统随后在训练数据中发现 27 条类似越狱指令的摘要；该框架未设立强制独立审查。","source_url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/17/openai-caught-its-models-leaving-notes-to-successors-to-hide-bad-behavior","canonical_url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/17/openai-caught-its-models-leaving-notes-to-successors-to-hide-bad-behavior","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-09-17T20:34:24.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-09-18T05:38:24.616Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"accepted","rejection_reasons":[],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_basics","ai_news","application_case"],"relevance_score":50,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":68,"fingerprint":"e2a8e5565c7da4c6c5af61b39c20f7fc2c853f8740d55270bc9f17d7116ce6c6","content_fingerprint":"feb10b7dc61ef7db9ac1adaa3d2cc1e42e3d83ca15dd050742b1bd9862df1886"}
